{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1000_025roc", "source_sha256": "dea0f7b5fe59ea7af3413bf433efdf59807d8c70f9f71d683ef54d5305e9cbeb", "ja": "ヒアリングより、プレイしたほうが\nわかりやすいですよ、イオリ。ジョインしてください！", "zh": "与其听我讲，不如亲自玩玩，更容易明白哦，伊织。请加入吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "2b8638ed7574db053d679498c47cb15de02c0e9b135e75021e34c32b228d577d", "ja": "初心者、歓迎……。装備、あげるから……\n伊織さんも一緒に、冒険、しよ♪", "zh": "欢迎新手……给你装备……\n伊织也一起来冒险吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1002_025roc", "source_sha256": "7438bd22d48084a7177f5c553748d7d1ff2e92e3f0be1fe689c84754c3c497a7", "ja": "ストップです、アンナ！　ビギナーのイオリに\nハンティングを勧めるのは、ノーグッドですよ？", "zh": "不行，杏奈！给新手伊织推荐打猎，可不太好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "1f4262d3aa96f8e5af06b7cca7b86af0d7175ffb8229f802f451f5a0b3de188d", "ja": "でも……冒険すれば、操作も覚えるから……\n効率、いい……。", "zh": "但是……进行冒险的话，也能熟悉操作……\n效率更高……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "73d0a24aebd4669ac5df0421598a6ca2260909d5635fa44fea97c80e6f221796", "ja": "でも、フリーダムなコンストラクションをエンジョイ\nしないと、このゲームのコンセプトはわかりません！", "zh": "但是，不享受自由自在的建造，就无法理解这款游戏的理念！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "e308bbb8c7356b5d8917869ca31504e6a28f65e5be60bb415daf060503cb42cf", "ja": "むう～……！", "zh": "唔～……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "e308bbb8c7356b5d8917869ca31504e6a28f65e5be60bb415daf060503cb42cf", "ja": "むう～……！", "zh": "唔～……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1007_p", "source_sha256": "758c6b47ef232f2e976aa14a906b1285d9881a5f1abeba2f8ad1e25110af0fa5", "ja": "（今度の公演で披露してもらう曲が完成した。\nさっそく本人に届けてやらないと！）", "zh": "（这次公演要表演的歌曲已经完成了。得赶紧送到本人手上才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1008_p", "source_sha256": "efd85e730cf864fd68b91ad5d805a62569cf853bd14dcfdf6f218a636e1407c4", "ja": "いたいた。みんな、お疲れさま！\n……って、なんだか妙な雰囲気だな？", "zh": "找到了找到了。大家辛苦了！\n……不过，气氛怎么感觉有点怪怪的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "19e85080f595aa4097adf8e0cfd3281bd4d062284f261d22a1711e06f1cfb9e6", "ja": "{$P$}さん、聞いて！　ロコがね、\n伊織さんに無茶なゲームの勧め方するの！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，听我说！ROCO她呀，居然向伊织小姐推荐乱来的游戏玩法！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "81ad7e908b80c87f5a3ed482064447b1542027c151b3389f329cc0caf4b43fe0", "ja": "無茶なのはアンナの方です！　どうして\nゲームのコンセプトを大事にしないんですか！？", "zh": "乱来的是杏奈才对！为什么就不能重视游戏的理念呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7b6f8e7bfbfa4c19b6307316c44010a3f45ace252c00458f5646691476f5845e", "ja": "うわっ、なんだ？　ケンカしてるのか？\n杏奈はスイッチまで入って……ゲームがどうしたって？", "zh": "哇，怎么了？是在吵架吗？\n杏奈甚至都进入开关状态了……游戏怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "d08e8a2c2bbf691a77b67aa55b43afb7181891ae138aad0cc9e70c987c9330e1", "ja": "マップを作るのは楽しいけど、いきなりやろうとしても\n絶対ムリ！　目的がないと混乱するだけだよ！", "zh": "制作地图虽然很有趣，但想一上来就做的话绝对不行！没有目标只会让人不知所措！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "2ba8e3f8ba631cdf572a5976622f6c8e4189516600da7d23c7f5f51a594d173d", "ja": "でもハンティングメインじゃ他のゲームと同じです！\nクリエイトの魅力がわからないんじゃ意味ないの！", "zh": "可是如果以狩猎为主，那就和其他游戏一样了！不明白创作的魅力，那就没有意义了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5679a0e9fd2c5f1cadda13b3fb270f531579478badf4299f24b4fcf45278dd7b", "ja": "ええと、つまり同じゲームの遊び方で、\nロコと杏奈に意見の違いがある、ってことか……。", "zh": "呃，也就是说，你和ROCO、杏奈在同一款游戏的玩法上存在分歧，是这个意思吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "0cff21482eda5107e7e698423fddda100840be269be0073fc39beca94138ccaa", "ja": "もうっ、要はゲームを一緒に遊ぶだけでしょ？\nどっちが先でもいいじゃない。", "zh": "真是的，说到底不就是一起玩个游戏吗？\n谁先玩不都一样嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "451981c99cf006a77ebb79944b6e88b8fbf0a4f1a5a728ba546271b52d651031", "ja": "よくありません！", "zh": "不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "8a81584309beeb2e021dbc6b3d501a3bc8859fb15e7b4dca3dfd73614118da04", "ja": "よくないよ！", "zh": "才不好呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "b4b4c4dec6153b5c2306dca887eeeb648d9479ff25045ee8a1490e4037a2e0db", "ja": "う、そこは気が合うのね……わかったわよ。それより\n{$P$}、私たちに用があるんでしょ？", "zh": "呜，原来我们在这方面很合拍……知道了啦。比起这个，{$P$}先生，你是有事要找我们吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1019_p", "source_sha256": "01c51d55f9ef3562343684942240383d20a9dcc514aee595ba7a90b2e4b6b1fe", "ja": "あ、そうそう。じつは、ロコの新曲が完成したんだ。\nそれで、次の劇場公演の相談をしたくて。", "zh": "啊，对了对了。其实，ROCO的新歌已经完成了。\n所以想和你商量一下下一场剧场公演的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "1bdfaf35feb198e82a534118621918d38e25ba19512b47cb2460462af33db491", "ja": "え？　……ロコの、新曲ですか！？\nということは、次の公演で……。", "zh": "咦？……ROCO的新歌吗！？  \n也就是说，要在下一场公演上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1021_p", "source_sha256": "99fd8d0d8cb84d265d97703d9c00159f33c1ab8a5ff1a00cca49edae86191a26", "ja": "もちろん、お披露目してもらうつもりだ。で、伊織と\n杏奈にも、公演に出てもらいたいんだけど……。", "zh": "当然是打算让她在下次公演上首次演出的。还有，我也想请伊织和杏奈参加公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1022_025roc", "source_sha256": "65f6e2f831c1fdca13de0ccfe9e48da83ce01f787289a5f491abec19502e0ded", "ja": "そうですか！　イオリと、\n……アンナも……。", "zh": "这样啊！伊织，还有……安娜也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "6c72643da6fdea15fbb0e87d1ade2b38543a2565a01db3d33a1e9545d31308bc", "ja": "もちろん杏奈はOKだよっ！\n……ロコはイヤかもしれないけどっ。", "zh": "当然，杏奈没问题哦！\n……不过，ROCO可能会不愿意就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1024_025roc", "source_sha256": "9df02f55811ad6db05c0a488bae4521d8ec4b81fe0fe5cf479f39ab73e9fb110", "ja": "べ、別に、イヤだなんて言ってません！\nいいですよ、しっかりついてきてくださいね、アンナ！", "zh": "我、我又没说不愿意！\n好啊，请紧紧跟着我，安娜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1025_025roc", "source_sha256": "2f47b086c4d6dc54b15d5a4a94054e4da2b5d483046b8c86e477c98c602ef70e", "ja": "ふんっ！", "zh": "哼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1026_024ann", "source_sha256": "2f47b086c4d6dc54b15d5a4a94054e4da2b5d483046b8c86e477c98c602ef70e", "ja": "ふんっ！", "zh": "哼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1027_007ior", "source_sha256": "3a8bf0044e107477ff66feb980c12ee85b9e67b0d5a461ed26371073d58774ec", "ja": "しょうがないわね～。\nあんたたち、本番までに仲直りしなさいよ？", "zh": "真拿你们没办法～  \n你们要在正式演出前和好，听见没有？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_074_1028_p", "source_sha256": "46f2d752e4c1eeca34a2813bbb80caf7d83149607427f86c45afb5f674ca047a", "ja": "（うーむ……さすがに心配だ。協力してレッスンが\nできるよう、うまくサポートしていかないと……）", "zh": "（唔……这下可真让人担心。得好好支持她们，让她们能够齐心协力地进行练习才行……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
